    {
      "source": "If the method parameter type is <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>, the name specified in the\nannotation is used to resolve the request parameter String value. The value is\nthen converted to a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> via type conversion assuming a suitable\n<a href=\"../../../../../core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a> has been registered. Or if a request parameter name is not\nspecified the <a href=\"RequestParamMapMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.reactive.result.method.annotation\"><code>RequestParamMapMethodArgumentResolver</code></a> is used instead\nto provide access to all request parameters in the form of a map.",
      "translation": "如果方法参数类型为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>，则使用注解中指定的名称来解析请求参数字符串值。该值随后通过类型转换转换为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>，前提是已注册了合适的 <a href=\"../../../../../core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a>。或者，如果未指定请求参数名称，则使用 <a href=\"RequestParamMapMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.reactive.result.method.annotation\"><code>RequestParamMapMethodArgumentResolver</code></a> 来以映射的形式访问所有请求参数。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This resolver can also be created in default resolution mode in which\nsimple types (int, long, etc.) not annotated with @<a href=\"../../../../bind/annotation/RequestParam.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.web.bind.annotation\"><code>RequestParam</code></a> are\nalso treated as request parameters with the parameter name derived from the\nargument name.",
      "translation": "该解析器也可以在默认解析模式下创建，在此模式下，未使用 `@<a href=\"../../../../bind/annotation/RequestParam.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.web.bind.annotation\"><code>RequestParam</code></a>` 注解的简单类型（如 int、long 等）也将被视为请求参数，其参数名称由参数名推导得出。",
      "count": 2
    },
