    {
      "source": "<code>useDefaultResolution</code> - in default resolution mode a method argument\nthat is a simple type, as defined in <a href=\"../../../../../beans/BeanUtils.html#isSimpleProperty(java.lang.Class)\"><code>BeanUtils.isSimpleProperty(Class)</code></a>,\nis treated as a request parameter even if it isn't annotated, the\nrequest parameter name is derived from the method parameter name.",
      "translation": "<code>useDefaultResolution</code> - 在默认解析模式下，即使未添加注解，只要方法参数是 <a href=\"../../../../../beans/BeanUtils.html#isSimpleProperty(java.lang.Class)\"><code>BeanUtils.isSimpleProperty(Class)</code></a> 中定义的简单类型，该参数即被视为请求参数，且请求参数名称由方法参数名称推导得出。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>factory</code> - a bean factory used for resolving  ${...} placeholder\nand #{...} SpEL expressions in default values, or <code>null</code> if default\nvalues are not expected to contain expressions",
      "translation": "`factory` - 用于解析默认值中的 `${...}` 占位符和 `#{...}` SpEL 表达式的 BeanFactory，或者如果预期默认值中不包含表达式则为 `<code>null</code>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
